---
import CtaBtn from '../website/cta-btn.astro';
---

  <section class="sec sec-light">
    <div class="container">

      <div class="row mb-2">
        <div class="col-12 text-center">
          <h2 class="zin-h2">Try Zin free for 14 days.</h2>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="row justify-content-center">
        <div class="col-lg-6">
          <div class="price-card">
            <div class="price-amount text-center mb-2">
              £9.97
              <span class="small">per month</span>
            </div>

            <ul class="price-list">
              <li><span class="price-tick">✓</span> No tiers. No upsells.</li>
              <li><span class="price-tick">✓</span> 14-day free trial included</li>
              <li><span class="price-tick">✓</span> Cancel anytime, no questions asked</li>
              <li><span class="price-tick">✓</span> Full refund if cancelled in trial period</li>
            </ul>
            <div class="text-center">
              <CtaBtn />
            </div>

          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="row justify-content-center mt-5">
        <div class="col-lg-8">
          <p class="zin-body-sm mb-3">Over time, a Zin library becomes something you would not give up. The value is not in any single month. It is in what accumulates.</p>
          <p class="zin-body-sm mb-3">Whatever you need your thinking for, the library is there. The ideas you had last year. The insight from this morning. None of it lost.</p>
          <p class="zin-body-sm mb-3">A credit card is required to start your trial, but no payment is taken for 14 days. See the cancellation and subscription policy below.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="row justify-content-center mt-4">
        <div class="col-lg-8 text-center">

          <details class="zin-details mb-4">
            <summary class="zin-details-summary">Cancellation and Subscription policy</summary>
            <div class="zin-details-body">
              <p class="zin-body mb-2">There is no long-term commitment with Zin.</p>
              <p class="zin-body mb-2">You will need a credit card to start your trial. No payment is taken for 14 days. After 14 days, the £9.97 monthly subscription begins automatically.</p>
              <p class="zin-body mb-2">You can cancel your Zin subscription at any time. To cancel, send an email to <a href="mailto:support@zincontent.com" class="zin-link-orange">support@zincontent.com</a>. We will cancel your subscription immediately, no questions asked. Refunds are managed by Stripe and are usually issued within 2–3 days.</p>
            </div>
          </details>

          <CtaBtn subtext="Your thinking is already worth more than this. Zin just makes sure none of it goes to waste." />

        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>